     - `local_78 = local_30` (the 8-byte header)
     - `local_70` low byte set to 1 (valid flag)
     - Calls `ChatSocket::recvn(this, _Memory, (int)((ulonglong)local_30 >> 0x20))` — **length is the high 32 bits of the header**.
